category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libX11-devel libXcursor-devel libXext-devel libXi-devel libXinerama-devel libXrandr-devel
sdesc: "Multi-platform library for OpenGL (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "GLFW is a free, Open Source, multi-platform library for OpenGL and OpenGL ES
application development. It provides a simple, platform-independent API for
creating windows and contexts, reading input, handling events, etc."
